"Controls","revokeSessionToken.button","errorNoSessions.title","errorNoSessions.desc","embeddedt, taumc and contributors","LGPL-3.0","Faster chunk rendering, based on Sodium for Minecraft 1.12. Draws the world with far fewer draw calls.","Entity Culling","Treasure Client, inspired by tr7zw","Built in","Skips drawing mobs, chests, signs and banners that are hidden behind solid blocks.","Enhanced Block Entities","FoundationGames","Draws chests, ender chests and beds as part of the world instead of one by one every frame. Chests switch back while their lid moves.",
"FoamFix","Treasure Client, inspired by asie","Less memory and a faster start: block states share one compact lookup instead of a table each, and identical model faces are stored once.","foamfix","Treasure Client, inspired by Speiger","Less memory: after textures load, frees the leftover pixel copies of every texture that never animates.","texfix","CensoredASM","Treasure Client, inspired by Rongmario","Less memory and faster lookups: one shared copy of each repeated name (blocks, items, textures, NBT tags), better block position hashing, and no forced memory cleanup when joining a world.",
"censoredasm","Celeritas Extra","Sumire-Labs","Extra switches for animations, particles, sky, weather, item frames, armor stands, paintings, beacon beams, enchanting books, pistons and toasts. Set them with the gear in Treasure Settings.","Celeritas Leaf Culling","Karnatour (fork of Sodium Leaf Culling)","MIT","With fancy leaves, skips leaf faces hidden inside trees. Pick Hollow, Solid Aggressive or Solid in Treasure Settings.","Lithium","CaffeineMC","Faster collisions, chunk lookups and block entity lists, with the same results. Also speeds up singleplayer.",
"ImmediatelyFast","RaphiMC","Cheaper name labels and signs: no rebuilding each name and re-measuring each sign line every frame, and no sign text past 32 blocks.","Dynamic FPS","juliand665","Drops to 10 FPS while another window is focused, so the game doesn\'t heat up your device in the background.","Memory Saver","Treasure Client","Stops the idle singleplayer engine while you\'re on a server and frees unused sounds after 2 minutes instead of 10.","VanillaFix","DimensionalDevelopment","Recovers from crashes instead of closing the game, and fixes Minecraft bugs (menus in portals, camera in grass, a memory leak).",
